      "message": "Hi David,\n\nSince I have plan to put ECDSA key certificate RPC to keymaster, \nis it possible to create two separate eic API like following to support EC key and cert?\n\nmDL reference CL: https://nugget-os-review.googlesource.com/c/core/nugget/+/30884/7/user/identity/EmbeddedIc/EmbeddedIc.c#203\nhttps://nugget-os-review.googlesource.com/c/core/nugget/+/30884/7/user/identity/identity_support.c#589\n\n    optional\u003cvector\u003cuint8_t\u003e\u003e pubKey\n    if (!eicCreateCredentialKey(\u0026eicCtx_, pubKey)) {\t\t// call mDL RPC to support ECDSA key generation\n        return ndk::ScopedAStatus(AStatus_fromServiceSpecificErrorWithMessage(\n            IIdentityCredentialStore::STATUS_FAILED,\n            \"Error generating credential key\"));\n    }\n\n\nkeymaster reference CL: https://nugget-os-review.googlesource.com/c/core/nugget/+/30684/8/user/keymaster/attest.c#21\n\n    if (!eicGenerateKeyCert(\u0026eicCtx_, pubKey\t\t\t// call keymaster RPC to support ECDSA key certificate generation\n                                attestationChallenge.data(), attestationChallenge.size(),\n                                attestationApplicationId.data(), attestationApplicationId.size(),\n                                publicKeyCert,\n                                \u0026publicKeyCertSize)) {\n        return ndk::ScopedAStatus(AStatus_fromServiceSpecificErrorWithMessage(\n            IIdentityCredentialStore::STATUS_FAILED,\n            \"Error generating attestation certificate\"));\n    }\n\nThank you,\nJoseph.",
